\f0\fs24 \cf0 For the 2025 performance at the NAC, there were two RBPi 5s used.  One for NDZ and one for PuDe.  \
\
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Each Pi however had both programs installed.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Each Pi was only dedicated to auto booting one of the programs.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}One Pi auto booted to NDZ\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}The other Pi auto booted to PuDe. \
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
The autoboot programs were set up locally on the RBPis individually and had not been updated to the GitHub during development or the performance. \
\
As I upload these programs to the repository, I am selectively only uploading the folders that were used in the performance, while maintaining the folder structure. \
\
That is to say that:  \
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}From the NDZ Pi, I only uploaded the NDZ folder (deleted the PuDe folder), along with the boot folder, and then deleted the PuDe autorun file from that boot folder. \
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Next, from the Pulse Decay Pi, I only uploaded the Pulse Decay folder from the Requiem for Radio folder (ignoring the NDZ folder), and then only uploaded the Pulse Decay autorun program from the boot folder. \
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \
I took this approach because coding changes were made on the Pis after the master Requiem for Radio folders were set up, and therefore there could potentially be changes to the NDZ program on the NDZ pi, that would not be present on the Pulse Decay Pi, and changes to the Pulse Decay code on the Pulse Decay pi, that would not be present on the NDZ pi. \
\
However, I think that the only changes might be to the autorun files, but I am not sure. \
\
To avoid version confusion, reduce duplication, and save memory, I am only uploading NDZ related files from the NDZ pi, and PuDe files from the PuDe pi.  \
\
There are some empty folders.  In order to maintain a record of those folders, I am inserting a short text document saying that these folders were empty, simply as a record of their presence at one point. \
